وب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null}]'::jsonb, '{}'::text[], 'Today''s profile: the competencies this role requires now, from the current role profile.', 'ملف اليوم: الكفاءات التي يتطلبها هذا الدور حالياً وفق ملف الدور الحالي.', '[{"id":"ssg75","label":"IAEA SSG-75 (2022) Recruitment, Qualification and Training of Personnel for NPPs","url":"https://www.iaea.org/node/109535","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-03-01T08:00:00Z', '2026-03-01T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-03-01T08:00:00Z'),
('rpv-senior-reactor-operator-2030-v1', 'senior-reactor-operator', '2030', 1, 'published', true, false, '[{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"co-01","level":4,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"co-02","level":4,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"co-03","level":4,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"ep-01","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"hu-01","level":4,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"ld-01","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"ld-02","level":4,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"ns-02","level":4,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"pf-01","level":4,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"pf-02","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"pf-03","level":4,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"Digital I&C screens and plant-data tools put trend reading and data checks into daily work.","why_ar":"تجعل شاشات الأجهزة والتحكم الرقمية وأدوات بيانات المحطة قراءة الاتجاهات والتحقق من البيانات جزءاً من العمل اليومي.","driver":"digital_ic"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-02","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"Teams will use approved AI tools; leaders need to know which uses are allowed and how they are governed.","why_ar":"ستستخدم الفرق أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي معتمدة؛ ويحتاج القادة إلى معرفة الاستخدامات المسموح بها وكيفية حوكمتها.","driver":"ai_assistance"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-fs-ai-verify","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"AI tools can draft and screen; people stay accountable for checking outputs before anyone acts on them.","why_ar":"يمكن لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي أن تصوغ وتفرز، لكن الإنسان يبقى مسؤولاً عن التحقق من المخرجات قبل التصرف بناءً عليها.","driver":"ai_assistance"}]'::jsonb, array['ai_assistance','digital_ic']::text[], 'By 2030, digital I&C, plant-data tools and AI-based operator aids are expected in every shift; operators read trends and verify any AI output before acting. Planning assumption; no deployment decision implied.', 'بحلول 2030 يُتوقع أن تكون الأجهزة والتحكم الرقمية وأدوات بيانات المحطة ومساعدات المشغّل القائمة على الذكاء الاصطناعي حاضرة في كل وردية؛ يقرأ المشغّلون الاتجاهات ويتحققون من أي مخرج للذكاء الاصطناعي قبل التصرف. افتراض تخطيطي؛ دون أي قرار نشر ضمني.', '[{"id":"sg-jtm","label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ssg-trends-2025","label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends in 2025 (AI potential on tasks, critical core skills)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-technology","label":"ENEC · Barakah technology","url":"https://www.enec.ae/barakah-plant/technology/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-presight","label":"ENEC · ENECIQ with Presight (Oct 2025)","url":"https://www.enec.ae/en/news/latest-news/enec-and-presight-co-develop-eneciq-ai-platform-to-boost-efficiency-and-knowledge-sharing/","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
