erify any AI output before acting. Planning assumption; no deployment decision implied.', 'بحلول 2030 يُتوقع أن تكون الأجهزة والتحكم الرقمية وأدوات بيانات المحطة ومساعدات المشغّل القائمة على الذكاء الاصطناعي حاضرة في كل وردية؛ يقرأ المشغّلون الاتجاهات ويتحققون من أي مخرج للذكاء الاصطناعي قبل التصرف. افتراض تخطيطي؛ دون أي قرار نشر ضمني.', '[{"id":"sg-jtm","label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ssg-trends-2025","label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends in 2025 (AI potential on tasks, critical core skills)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-technology","label":"ENEC · Barakah technology","url":"https://www.enec.ae/barakah-plant/technology/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-presight","label":"ENEC · ENECIQ with Presight (Oct 2025)","url":"https://www.enec.ae/en/news/latest-news/enec-and-presight-co-develop-eneciq-ai-platform-to-boost-efficiency-and-knowledge-sharing/","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
('rpv-local-operator-2035-v1', 'local-operator', '2035', 1, 'published', true, false, '[{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"co-01","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"co-02","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"hu-01","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"pf-02","level":2,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"pf-03","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"rp-01","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"Digital I&C screens and plant-data tools put trend reading and data checks into daily work.","why_ar":"تجعل شاشات الأجهزة والتحكم الرقمية وأدوات بيانات المحطة قراءة الاتجاهات والتحقق من البيانات جزءاً من العمل اليومي.","driver":"digital_ic"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01-twins","level":1,"importance":"useful","why_en":"Digital twins support what-if reviews and training; they stay separate from reactor control systems.","why_ar":"تدعم التوائم الرقمية مراجعات \"ماذا لو\" والتدريب، وتبقى منفصلة عن أنظمة التحكم في المفاعل.","driver":"digital_twin"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-fs-ai-verify","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"AI tools can draft and screen; people stay accountable for checking outputs before anyone acts on them.","why_ar":"يمكن لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي أن تصوغ وتفرز، لكن الإنسان يبقى مسؤولاً عن التحقق من المخرجات قبل التصرف بناءً عليها.","driver":"ai_assistance"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-fs-dp-robotics","level":1,"importance":"useful","why_en":"Crawlers, drones and remote cameras reduce dose and outage time for inspections.","why_ar":"تقلل الروبوتات الزاحفة والطائرات المسيّرة والكاميرات عن بعد الجرعة الإشعاعية ومدة الانقطاع في أعمال التفتيش.","driver":"robotics"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-pf-02-advcool","level":1,"importance":"useful","why_en":"Awareness of passive safety and advanced coolants prepares for any future advanced-reactor work; no deployment decision implied.","why_ar":"يهيئ الوعي بالسلامة الذاتية والمبرّدات المتقدمة لأي عمل مستقبلي على المفاعلات المتقدمة؛ دون أي قرار نشر ضمني.","driver":"smr_design"}]'::jsonb, array['ai_assistance','digital_ic','digital_twin','robotics','smr_design']::text[], 'By 2035, twin-based what-if reviews and awareness of advanced reactor concepts round out the operator profile. Planning assumption; no deployment decision implied.', 'بحلول 2035 تكمل مراجعات "ماذا لو" القائمة على التوائم الرقمية والوعي بمفاهيم المفاعلات المتقدمة ملف المشغّل. افتراض تخطيطي؛ دون أي قرار نشر ضمني.', '[{"id":"sg-jtm","label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ssg-trends-2025","label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends in 2025 (AI potential on tasks, critical core skills)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-technology","label":"ENEC · Barakah technology","url":"https://www.enec.ae/barakah-plant/technology/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-presight","label":"ENEC · ENECIQ with Presight (Oct 2025)","url":"https://www.enec.ae/en/news/latest-news/enec-and-presight-co-develop-eneciq-ai-platform-to-boost-efficiency-and-knowledge-sharing/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-tii","label":"ENEC · TII and ASPIRE autonomous aerial systems (Jan 2026)","url":"https://www.enec.ae/en/news/latest-news/enec-tii-and-aspire-collaborate-on-autonomous-aerial-systems-to-enhance-critical-infrastructure/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"wnn-advance","label":"WNN · ENEC to evaluate deployment of SMRs and microreactors (ADVANCE)","url":"https://world-nuclear-news.org/articles/enec-to-evaluate-deployment-of-smrs-and-microreact","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
