ذكاء الاصطناعي أن تصوغ وتفرز، لكن الإنسان يبقى مسؤولاً عن التحقق من المخرجات قبل التصرف بناءً عليها.","driver":"ai_assistance"}]'::jsonb, array['ai_assistance','digital_ic']::text[], 'By 2030, engineering analysis starts from plant data and scripted calculations, and AI-drafted outputs are always independently checked. Planning assumption; no deployment decision implied.', 'بحلول 2030 يبدأ التحليل الهندسي من بيانات المحطة والحسابات المؤتمتة، ويُتحقق دائماً بشكل مستقل من المخرجات التي يصوغها الذكاء الاصطناعي. افتراض تخطيطي؛ دون أي قرار نشر ضمني.', '[{"id":"sg-jtm","label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ssg-trends-2025","label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends in 2025 (AI potential on tasks, critical core skills)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-technology","label":"ENEC · Barakah technology","url":"https://www.enec.ae/barakah-plant/technology/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-presight","label":"ENEC · ENECIQ with Presight (Oct 2025)","url":"https://www.enec.ae/en/news/latest-news/enec-and-presight-co-develop-eneciq-ai-platform-to-boost-efficiency-and-knowledge-sharing/","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
('rpv-systems-design-plant-engineer-2035-v1', 'systems-design-plant-engineer', '2035', 1, 'published', true, false, '[{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"da-01","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Digital tools and data literacy move from a specialist skill to an expected one for this role.","why_ar":"تنتقل الأدوات الرقمية ومحو الأمية البيانية من مهارة تخصصية إلى مهارة متوقعة لهذا الدور.","driver":"digital_ic"},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"en-01","level":4,"importance":"core","why_en":"Design control has to cover software and data models as configuration items.","why_ar":"يجب أن يشمل ضبط التصميم البرمجيات ونماذج البيانات بوصفها عناصر تهيئة.","driver":"digital_twin"},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"en-02","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"ns-01","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"pf-03","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01-analysis","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Engineering judgement increasingly starts from plant data: trending, simple statistics and clear charts.","why_ar":"يبدأ الحكم الهندسي بشكل متزايد من بيانات المحطة: تحليل الاتجاهات والإحصاءات البسيطة والرسوم الواضحة.","driver":"digital_ic"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01-scripting","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"Small scripts automate repetitive engineering calculations and data preparation under configuration control.","why_ar":"تؤتمت البرامج النصية الصغيرة الحسابات الهندسية المتكررة وإعداد البيانات تحت ضبط التهيئة.","driver":"digital_ic"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01-twins","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Digital twins support what-if reviews and training; they stay separate from reactor control systems.","why_ar":"تدعم التوائم الرقمية مراجعات \"ماذا لو\" والتدريب، وتبقى منفصلة عن أنظمة التحكم في المفاعل.","driver":"digital_twin"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-fs-ai-verify","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"AI tools can draft and screen; people stay accountable for checking outputs before anyone acts on them.","why_ar":"يمكن لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي أن تصوغ وتفرز، لكن الإنسان يبقى مسؤولاً عن التحقق من المخرجات قبل التصرف بناءً عليها.","driver":"ai_assistance"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-pf-02-advcool","level":2,"importance":"useful","why_en":"Awareness of passive safety and advanced coolants prepares for any future advanced-reactor work; no deployment decision implied.","why_ar":"يهيئ الوعي بالسلامة الذاتية والمبرّدات المتقدمة لأي عمل مستقبلي على المفاعلات المتقدمة؛ دون أي قرار نشر ضمني.","driver":"smr_design"}]'::jsonb, array['ai_assistance','digital_ic','digital_twin','smr_design']::text[], 'By 2035, engineers maintain digital twins as controlled configuration items and understand advanced reactor fundamentals. Planning assumption; no deployment decision implied.', 'بحلول 2035 يدير المهندسون التوائم الرقمية بوصفها عناصر تهيئة مضبوطة ويفهمون أساسيات المفاعلات المتقدمة. افتراض تخطيطي؛ دون أي قرار نشر ضمني.', '[{"id":"sg-jtm","label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ssg-trends-2025","label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends in 2025 (AI potential on tasks, critical core skills)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-technology","label":"ENEC · Barakah technology","url":"https://www.enec.ae/barakah-plant/technology/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-presight","label":"ENEC · ENECIQ with Presight (Oct 2025)","url":"https://www.enec.ae/en/news/latest-news/enec-and-presight-co-develop-eneciq-ai-platform-to-boost-efficiency-and-knowledge-sharing/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"wnn-advance","label":"WNN · ENEC to evaluate deployment of SMRs and microreactors (ADVANCE)","url":"https://world-nuclear-news.org/articles/enec-to-evaluate-deployment-of-smrs-and-microreact","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
