('rpv-corporate-professional-2030-v1', 'corporate-professional', '2030', 1, 'published', true, false, '[{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"da-01","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Digital tools and data literacy move from a specialist skill to an expected one for this role.","why_ar":"تنتقل الأدوات الرقمية ومحو الأمية البيانية من مهارة تخصصية إلى مهارة متوقعة لهذا الدور.","driver":"digital_ic"},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"da-02","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Governed use of AI becomes part of everyday work for this role.","why_ar":"يصبح الاستخدام المحوكم للذكاء الاصطناعي جزءاً من العمل اليومي لهذا الدور.","driver":"ai_assistance"},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"ld-01","level":2,"importance":"useful","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"sc-01","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01-analysis","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"Engineering judgement increasingly starts from plant data: trending, simple statistics and clear charts.","why_ar":"يبدأ الحكم الهندسي بشكل متزايد من بيانات المحطة: تحليل الاتجاهات والإحصاءات البسيطة والرسوم الواضحة.","driver":"digital_ic"}]'::jsonb, array['ai_assistance','digital_ic']::text[], 'By 2030, corporate and supply work relies on data analysis and governed AI tools. Planning assumption; no deployment decision implied.', 'بحلول 2030 يعتمد العمل المؤسسي وأعمال التوريد على تحليل البيانات وأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي المحوكمة. افتراض تخطيطي؛ دون أي قرار نشر ضمني.', '[{"id":"sg-jtm","label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ssg-trends-2025","label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends in 2025 (AI potential on tasks, critical core skills)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-technology","label":"ENEC · Barakah technology","url":"https://www.enec.ae/barakah-plant/technology/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-presight","label":"ENEC · ENECIQ with Presight (Oct 2025)","url":"https://www.enec.ae/en/news/latest-news/enec-and-presight-co-develop-eneciq-ai-platform-to-boost-efficiency-and-knowledge-sharing/","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
('rpv-corporate-professional-2035-v1', 'corporate-professional', '2035', 1, 'published', true, false, '[{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"da-01","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Digital tools and data literacy move from a specialist skill to an expected one for this role.","why_ar":"تنتقل الأدوات الرقمية ومحو الأمية البيانية من مهارة تخصصية إلى مهارة متوقعة لهذا الدور.","driver":"digital_ic"},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"da-02","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Governed use of AI becomes part of everyday work for this role.","why_ar":"يصبح الاستخدام المحوكم للذكاء الاصطناعي جزءاً من العمل اليومي لهذا الدور.","driver":"ai_assistance"},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"ld-01","level":2,"importance":"useful","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"sc-01","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"Required today (current role profile).","why_ar":"مطلوب اليوم (ملف الدور الحالي).","driver":null},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01-analysis","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"Engineering judgement increasingly starts from plant data: trending, simple statistics and clear charts.","why_ar":"يبدأ الحكم الهندسي بشكل متزايد من بيانات المحطة: تحليل الاتجاهات والإحصاءات البسيطة والرسوم الواضحة.","driver":"digital_ic"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01-scripting","level":1,"importance":"useful","why_en":"Small scripts automate repetitive engineering calculations and data preparation under configuration control.","why_ar":"تؤتمت البرامج النصية الصغيرة الحسابات الهندسية المتكررة وإعداد البيانات تحت ضبط التهيئة.","driver":"digital_ic"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-fs-ai-verify","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"AI tools can draft and screen; people stay accountable for checking outputs before anyone acts on them.","why_ar":"يمكن لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي أن تصوغ وتفرز، لكن الإنسان يبقى مسؤولاً عن التحقق من المخرجات قبل التصرف بناءً عليها.","driver":"ai_assistance"}]'::jsonb, array['ai_assistance','digital_ic']::text[], 'By 2035, checking AI outputs and working with modular supply chains is expected at practitioner level. Planning assumption; no deployment decision implied.', 'بحلول 2035 يُتوقع التحقق من مخرجات الذكاء الاصطناعي والعمل مع سلاسل التوريد المعيارية على مستوى الممارس. افتراض تخطيطي؛ دون أي قرار نشر ضمني.', '[{"id":"sg-jtm","label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ssg-trends-2025","label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends in 2025 (AI potential on tasks, critical core skills)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-technology","label":"ENEC · Barakah technology","url":"https://www.enec.ae/barakah-plant/technology/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-presight","label":"ENEC · ENECIQ with Presight (Oct 2025)","url":"https://www.enec.ae/en/news/latest-news/enec-and-presight-co-develop-eneciq-ai-platform-to-boost-efficiency-and-knowledge-sharing/","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
('rpv-fr-bwr-operator-2035-v1', 'fr-bwr-operator', '2035', 1, 'published', true, false, '[{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"co-01","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"co-03","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"hu-01","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"ns-01","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"pf-02","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-fs-ai-verify","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"AI tools can draft and screen; people stay accountable for checking outputs before anyone acts on them.","why_ar":"يمكن لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي أن تصوغ وتفرز، لكن الإنسان يبقى مسؤولاً عن التحقق من المخرجات قبل التصرف بناءً عليها.","driver":"ai_assistance"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-pf-02-advcool","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"Awareness of passive safety and advanced coolants prepares for any future advanced-reactor work; no deployment decision implied.","why_ar":"يهيئ الوعي بالسلامة الذاتية والمبرّدات المتقدمة لأي عمل مستقبلي على المفاعلات المتقدمة؛ دون أي قرار نشر ضمني.","driver":"smr_design"}]'::jsonb, array['ai_assistance','smr_design']::text[], 'Concept profile for 2035: A licensed-operator path for a small boiling water reactor, building on APR-1400 conduct of operations. Requirements are planning assumptions for learning and career conversations; no vacancy and no deployment decision implied.', 'ملف مفاهيمي لعام 2035: مسار مشغّل مرخّص لمفاعل ماء مغلي صغير يبني على إدارة العمليات في APR-1400. المتطلبات افتراضات تخطيطية لأغراض التعلّم والحوار المهني؛ لا توجد وظيفة شاغرة ولا قرار نشر ضمني.', '[{"id":"sg-jtm","label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ssg-trends-2025","label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends in 2025 (AI potential on tasks, critical core skills)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-presight","label":"ENEC · ENECIQ with Presight (Oct 2025)","url":"https://www.enec.ae/en/news/latest-news/enec-and-presight-co-develop-eneciq-ai-platform-to-boost-efficiency-and-knowledge-sharing/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"wnn-advance","label":"WNN · ENEC to evaluate deployment of SMRs and microreactors (ADVANCE)","url":"https://world-nuclear-news.org/articles/enec-to-evaluate-deployment-of-smrs-and-microreact","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
('rpv-fr-remote-ops-2035-v1', 'fr-remote-ops', '2035', 1, 'published', true, false, '[{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"co-01","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"ns-01","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Digital I&C screens and plant-data tools put trend reading and data checks into daily work.","why_ar":"تجعل شاشات الأجهزة والتحكم الرقمية وأدوات بيانات المحطة قراءة الاتجاهات والتحقق من البيانات جزءاً من العمل اليومي.","driver":"digital_ic"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01-remote","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Remote monitoring of factory-built units asks for oversight of automated functions from a central room.","why_ar":"تتطلب المراقبة عن بعد للوحدات المصنّعة في المصنع الإشراف على الوظائف المؤتمتة من غرفة مركزية.","driver":"digital_ic"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-fs-ai-verify","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"AI tools can draft and screen; people stay accountable for checking outputs before anyone acts on them.","why_ar":"يمكن لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي أن تصوغ وتفرز، لكن الإنسان يبقى مسؤولاً عن التحقق من المخرجات قبل التصرف بناءً عليها.","driver":"ai_assistance"}]'::jsonb, array['ai_assistance','digital_ic']::text[], 'Concept profile for 2035: Monitors factory-built units from a central room and oversees autonomous control functions. Requirements are planning assumptions for learning and career conversations; no vacancy and no deployment decision implied.', 'ملف مفاهيمي لعام 2035: يراقب الوحدات المصنّعة في المصنع من غرفة مركزية ويشرف على وظائف التحكم الذاتي. المتطلبات افتراضات تخطيطية لأغراض التعلّم والحوار المهني؛ لا توجد وظيفة شاغرة ولا قرار نشر ضمني.', '[{"id":"sg-jtm","label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ssg-trends-2025","label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends in 2025 (AI potential on tasks, critical core skills)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-technology","label":"ENEC · Barakah technology","url":"https://www.enec.ae/barakah-plant/technology/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-presight","label":"ENEC · ENECIQ with Presight (Oct 2025)","url":"https://www.enec.ae/en/news/latest-news/enec-and-presight-co-develop-eneciq-ai-platform-to-boost-efficiency-and-knowledge-sharing/","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
('rpv-fr-liquid-metal-2035-v1', 'fr-liquid-metal', '2035', 1, 'published', true, false, '[{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"en-01","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Design control has to cover software and data models as configuration items.","why_ar":"يجب أن يشمل ضبط التصميم البرمجيات ونماذج البيانات بوصفها عناصر تهيئة.","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"ns-01","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-ch-01-advchem","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"Liquid-metal and molten-salt chemistry follow different control rules from water chemistry.","why_ar":"تتبع كيمياء المعادن السائلة والأملاح المنصهرة قواعد ضبط مختلفة عن كيمياء المياه.","driver":"smr_design"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-fs-dp-robotics","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"Crawlers, drones and remote cameras reduce dose and outage time for inspections.","why_ar":"تقلل الروبوتات الزاحفة والطائرات المسيّرة والكاميرات عن بعد الجرعة الإشعاعية ومدة الانقطاع في أعمال التفتيش.","driver":"robotics"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-pf-02-advcool","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Awareness of passive safety and advanced coolants prepares for any future advanced-reactor work; no deployment decision implied.","why_ar":"يهيئ الوعي بالسلامة الذاتية والمبرّدات المتقدمة لأي عمل مستقبلي على المفاعلات المتقدمة؛ دون أي قرار نشر ضمني.","driver":"smr_design"}]'::jsonb, array['robotics','smr_design']::text[], 'Concept profile for 2035: Designs and supports systems that handle sodium or lead coolants. Requirements are planning assumptions for learning and career conversations; no vacancy and no deployment decision implied.', 'ملف مفاهيمي لعام 2035: يصمم الأنظمة التي تتعامل مع مبرّدات الصوديوم أو الرصاص ويدعمها. المتطلبات افتراضات تخطيطية لأغراض التعلّم والحوار المهني؛ لا توجد وظيفة شاغرة ولا قرار نشر ضمني.', '[{"id":"sg-jtm","label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ssg-trends-2025","label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends in 2025 (AI potential on tasks, critical core skills)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-tii","label":"ENEC · TII and ASPIRE autonomous aerial systems (Jan 2026)","url":"https://www.enec.ae/en/news/latest-news/enec-tii-and-aspire-collaborate-on-autonomous-aerial-systems-to-enhance-critical-infrastructure/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"wnn-advance","label":"WNN · ENEC to evaluate deployment of SMRs and microreactors (ADVANCE)","url":"https://world-nuclear-news.org/articles/enec-to-evaluate-deployment-of-smrs-and-microreact","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
('rpv-fr-salt-chemist-2035-v1', 'fr-salt-chemist', '2035', 1, 'published', true, false, '[{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"ch-01","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"rp-01","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-ch-01-advchem","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Liquid-metal and molten-salt chemistry follow different control rules from water chemistry.","why_ar":"تتبع كيمياء المعادن السائلة والأملاح المنصهرة قواعد ضبط مختلفة عن كيمياء المياه.","driver":"smr_design"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-ch-02-labqa","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Laboratory QA keeps new analytical methods traceable.","why_ar":"تحافظ ضمانة جودة المختبر على إمكانية تتبع طرق التحليل الجديدة.","driver":null},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01-analysis","level":2,"importance":"useful","why_en":"Engineering judgement increasingly starts from plant data: trending, simple statistics and clear charts.","why_ar":"يبدأ الحكم الهندسي بشكل متزايد من بيانات المحطة: تحليل الاتجاهات والإحصاءات البسيطة والرسوم الواضحة.","driver":"digital_ic"}]'::jsonb, array['digital_ic','smr_design']::text[], 'Concept profile for 2035: Controls salt chemistry and corrosion in molten salt systems. Requirements are planning assumptions for learning and career conversations; no vacancy and no deployment decision implied.', 'ملف مفاهيمي لعام 2035: يضبط كيمياء الأملاح والتآكل في أنظمة الأملاح المنصهرة. المتطلبات افتراضات تخطيطية لأغراض التعلّم والحوار المهني؛ لا توجد وظيفة شاغرة ولا قرار نشر ضمني.', '[{"id":"sg-jtm","label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ssg-trends-2025","label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends in 2025 (AI potential on tasks, critical core skills)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-technology","label":"ENEC · Barakah technology","url":"https://www.enec.ae/barakah-plant/technology/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"wnn-advance","label":"WNN · ENEC to evaluate deployment of SMRs and microreactors (ADVANCE)","url":"https://world-nuclear-news.org/articles/enec-to-evaluate-deployment-of-smrs-and-microreact","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
('rpv-fr-ht-materials-2035-v1', 'fr-ht-materials', '2035', 1, 'published', true, false, '[{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"en-01","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Design control has to cover software and data models as configuration items.","why_ar":"يجب أن يشمل ضبط التصميم البرمجيات ونماذج البيانات بوصفها عناصر تهيئة.","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"qa-01","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01-analysis","level":2,"importance":"useful","why_en":"Engineering judgement increasingly starts from plant data: trending, simple statistics and clear charts.","why_ar":"يبدأ الحكم الهندسي بشكل متزايد من بيانات المحطة: تحليل الاتجاهات والإحصاءات البسيطة والرسوم الواضحة.","driver":"digital_ic"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-pf-01-advfuel","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"Advanced fuel forms and core materials differ from today''s fuel; specialists need the fundamentals first.","why_ar":"تختلف أشكال الوقود المتقدم ومواد القلب عن الوقود الحالي، ويحتاج المختصون إلى الأساسيات أولاً.","driver":"smr_design"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-pf-02-advcool","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"Awareness of passive safety and advanced coolants prepares for any future advanced-reactor work; no deployment decision implied.","why_ar":"يهيئ الوعي بالسلامة الذاتية والمبرّدات المتقدمة لأي عمل مستقبلي على المفاعلات المتقدمة؛ دون أي قرار نشر ضمني.","driver":"smr_design"}]'::jsonb, array['digital_ic','smr_design']::text[], 'Concept profile for 2035: Qualifies graphite, alloys and coatings for high-temperature service. Requirements are planning assumptions for learning and career conversations; no vacancy and no deployment decision implied.', 'ملف مفاهيمي لعام 2035: يؤهل الغرافيت والسبائك والطلاءات للخدمة في درجات حرارة عالية. المتطلبات افتراضات تخطيطية لأغراض التعلّم والحوار المهني؛ لا توجد وظيفة شاغرة ولا قرار نشر ضمني.', '[{"id":"sg-jtm","label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ssg-trends-2025","label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends in 2025 (AI potential on tasks, critical core skills)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-technology","label":"ENEC · Barakah technology","url":"https://www.enec.ae/barakah-plant/technology/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"wnn-advance","label":"WNN · ENEC to evaluate deployment of SMRs and microreactors (ADVANCE)","url":"https://world-nuclear-news.org/articles/enec-to-evaluate-deployment-of-smrs-and-microreact","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
('rpv-fr-adv-fuel-2035-v1', 'fr-adv-fuel', '2035', 1, 'published', true, false, '[{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"ns-02","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"pf-01","level":4,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"qa-01","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01-scripting","level":2,"importance":"useful","why_en":"Small scripts automate repetitive engineering calculations and data preparation under configuration control.","why_ar":"تؤتمت البرامج النصية الصغيرة الحسابات الهندسية المتكررة وإعداد البيانات تحت ضبط التهيئة.","driver":"digital_ic"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-pf-01-advfuel","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Advanced fuel forms and core materials differ from today''s fuel; specialists need the fundamentals first.","why_ar":"تختلف أشكال الوقود المتقدم ومواد القلب عن الوقود الحالي، ويحتاج المختصون إلى الأساسيات أولاً.","driver":"smr_design"}]'::jsonb, array['digital_ic','smr_design']::text[], 'Concept profile for 2035: Works on coated-particle and fast-reactor fuel forms and their supply chains. Requirements are planning assumptions for learning and career conversations; no vacancy and no deployment decision implied.', 'ملف مفاهيمي لعام 2035: يعمل على أشكال الوقود ذي الجسيمات المغلفة ووقود المفاعلات السريعة وسلاسل إمدادها. المتطلبات افتراضات تخطيطية لأغراض التعلّم والحوار المهني؛ لا توجد وظيفة شاغرة ولا قرار نشر ضمني.', '[{"id":"sg-jtm","label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ssg-trends-2025","label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends in 2025 (AI potential on tasks, critical core skills)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-technology","label":"ENEC · Barakah technology","url":"https://www.enec.ae/barakah-plant/technology/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"wnn-advance","label":"WNN · ENEC to evaluate deployment of SMRs and microreactors (ADVANCE)","url":"https://world-nuclear-news.org/articles/enec-to-evaluate-deployment-of-smrs-and-microreact","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
('rpv-fr-adv-licensing-2035-v1', 'fr-adv-licensing', '2035', 1, 'published', true, false, '[{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"en-01","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Design control has to cover software and data models as configuration items.","why_ar":"يجب أن يشمل ضبط التصميم البرمجيات ونماذج البيانات بوصفها عناصر تهيئة.","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"ns-01","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"ns-02","level":4,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-fs-ai-verify","level":2,"importance":"useful","why_en":"AI tools can draft and screen; people stay accountable for checking outputs before anyone acts on them.","why_ar":"يمكن لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي أن تصوغ وتفرز، لكن الإنسان يبقى مسؤولاً عن التحقق من المخرجات قبل التصرف بناءً عليها.","driver":"ai_assistance"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-ns-02-licensing","level":4,"importance":"core","why_en":"A new design would need its own licensing basis built with the regulator; no proposal has been made.","why_ar":"يحتاج أي تصميم جديد إلى أساس ترخيص خاص يُبنى مع الجهة الرقابية؛ ولم يُقدَّم أي مقترح.","driver":"smr_design"}]'::jsonb, array['ai_assistance','smr_design']::text[], 'Concept profile for 2035: Builds a licensing basis for a new design with the regulator; no proposal has been made to FANR. Requirements are planning assumptions for learning and career conversations; no vacancy and no deployment decision implied.', 'ملف مفاهيمي لعام 2035: يبني أساس الترخيص لتصميم جديد مع الجهة الرقابية؛ ولم يُقدَّم أي مقترح إلى الهيئة. المتطلبات افتراضات تخطيطية لأغراض التعلّم والحوار المهني؛ لا توجد وظيفة شاغرة ولا قرار نشر ضمني.', '[{"id":"sg-jtm","label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ssg-trends-2025","label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends in 2025 (AI potential on tasks, critical core skills)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-presight","label":"ENEC · ENECIQ with Presight (Oct 2025)","url":"https://www.enec.ae/en/news/latest-news/enec-and-presight-co-develop-eneciq-ai-platform-to-boost-efficiency-and-knowledge-sharing/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"wnn-advance","label":"WNN · ENEC to evaluate deployment of SMRs and microreactors (ADVANCE)","url":"https://world-nuclear-news.org/articles/enec-to-evaluate-deployment-of-smrs-and-microreact","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
