s%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"wnn-advance","label":"WNN · ENEC to evaluate deployment of SMRs and microreactors (ADVANCE)","url":"https://world-nuclear-news.org/articles/enec-to-evaluate-deployment-of-smrs-and-microreact","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
('rpv-fr-owners-engineer-2035-v1', 'fr-owners-engineer', '2035', 1, 'published', true, false, '[{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"en-01","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Design control has to cover software and data models as configuration items.","why_ar":"يجب أن يشمل ضبط التصميم البرمجيات ونماذج البيانات بوصفها عناصر تهيئة.","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"ld-01","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"qa-01","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01-analysis","level":2,"importance":"useful","why_en":"Engineering judgement increasingly starts from plant data: trending, simple statistics and clear charts.","why_ar":"يبدأ الحكم الهندسي بشكل متزايد من بيانات المحطة: تحليل الاتجاهات والإحصاءات البسيطة والرسوم الواضحة.","driver":"digital_ic"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-en-01-project","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Factory-built modules and international projects shift work towards project controls and owner''s engineering.","why_ar":"تنقل الوحدات المصنّعة في المصنع والمشاريع الدولية العمل نحو ضبط المشاريع وهندسة المالك.","driver":"smr_design"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-qa-02-cgd","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"New suppliers and modules need commercial-grade dedication done right the first time.","why_ar":"يحتاج الموردون والوحدات الجدد إلى اعتماد سليم للمكونات التجارية من المرة الأولى.","driver":"smr_design"}]'::jsonb, array['digital_ic','smr_design']::text[], 'Concept profile for 2035: Represents the owner on projects abroad, in line with ENEC Consulting''s advisory work. Requirements are planning assumptions for learning and career conversations; no vacancy and no deployment decision implied.', 'ملف مفاهيمي لعام 2035: يمثل المالك في المشاريع الخارجية بما يتماشى مع العمل الاستشاري لـENEC للاستشارات. المتطلبات افتراضات تخطيطية لأغراض التعلّم والحوار المهني؛ لا توجد وظيفة شاغرة ولا قرار نشر ضمني.', '[{"id":"sg-jtm","label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ssg-trends-2025","label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends in 2025 (AI potential on tasks, critical core skills)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-technology","label":"ENEC · Barakah technology","url":"https://www.enec.ae/barakah-plant/technology/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"wnn-advance","label":"WNN · ENEC to evaluate deployment of SMRs and microreactors (ADVANCE)","url":"https://world-nuclear-news.org/articles/enec-to-evaluate-deployment-of-smrs-and-microreact","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
('rpv-fr-digital-twin-2030-v1', 'fr-digital-twin', '2030', 1, 'published', true, false, '[{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"en-02","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"System health monitoring relies more on continuous data and fewer manual walk-downs.","why_ar":"تعتمد مراقبة سلامة الأنظمة أكثر على البيانات المستمرة وبدرجة أقل على الجولات اليدوية.","driver":null},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01-analysis","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Engineering judgement increasingly starts from plant data: trending, simple statistics and clear charts.","why_ar":"يبدأ الحكم الهندسي بشكل متزايد من بيانات المحطة: تحليل الاتجاهات والإحصاءات البسيطة والرسوم الواضحة.","driver":"digital_twin"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01-scripting","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"Small scripts automate repetitive engineering calculations and data preparation under configuration control.","why_ar":"تؤتمت البرامج النصية الصغيرة الحسابات الهندسية المتكررة وإعداد البيانات تحت ضبط التهيئة.","driver":"digital_ic"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01-twins","level":2,"importance":"core","why_en":"Digital twins support what-if reviews and training; they stay separate from reactor control systems.","why_ar":"تدعم التوائم الرقمية مراجعات \"ماذا لو\" والتدريب، وتبقى منفصلة عن أنظمة التحكم في المفاعل.","driver":"digital_twin"}]'::jsonb, array['digital_ic','digital_twin']::text[], 'Concept profile for 2030: Builds and governs digital twins, separate from reactor control systems. Requirements are planning assumptions for learning and career conversations; no vacancy and no deployment decision implied.', 'ملف مفاهيمي لعام 2030: يبني التوائم الرقمية ويحوكمها بمعزل عن أنظمة التحكم في المفاعل. المتطلبات افتراضات تخطيطية لأغراض التعلّم والحوار المهني؛ لا توجد وظيفة شاغرة ولا قرار نشر ضمني.', '[{"id":"sg-jtm","label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ssg-trends-2025","label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends in 2025 (AI potential on tasks, critical core skills)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-technology","label":"ENEC · Barakah technology","url":"https://www.enec.ae/barakah-plant/technology/","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
('rpv-fr-digital-twin-2035-v1', 'fr-digital-twin', '2035', 1, 'published', true, false, '[{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"en-02","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"System health monitoring relies more on continuous data and fewer manual walk-downs.","why_ar":"تعتمد مراقبة سلامة الأنظمة أكثر على البيانات المستمرة وبدرجة أقل على الجولات اليدوية.","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"pf-03","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01-analysis","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Engineering judgement increasingly starts from plant data: trending, simple statistics and clear charts.","why_ar":"يبدأ الحكم الهندسي بشكل متزايد من بيانات المحطة: تحليل الاتجاهات والإحصاءات البسيطة والرسوم الواضحة.","driver":"digital_twin"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01-scripting","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Small scripts automate repetitive engineering calculations and data preparation under configuration control.","why_ar":"تؤتمت البرامج النصية الصغيرة الحسابات الهندسية المتكررة وإعداد البيانات تحت ضبط التهيئة.","driver":"digital_ic"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01-twins","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Digital twins support what-if reviews and training; they stay separate from reactor control systems.","why_ar":"تدعم التوائم الرقمية مراجعات \"ماذا لو\" والتدريب، وتبقى منفصلة عن أنظمة التحكم في المفاعل.","driver":"digital_twin"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-fs-ai-verify","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"AI tools can draft and screen; people stay accountable for checking outputs before anyone acts on them.","why_ar":"يمكن لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي أن تصوغ وتفرز، لكن الإنسان يبقى مسؤولاً عن التحقق من المخرجات قبل التصرف بناءً عليها.","driver":"ai_assistance"}]'::jsonb, array['ai_assistance','digital_ic','digital_twin']::text[], 'Concept profile for 2035: Builds and governs digital twins, separate from reactor control systems. Requirements are planning assumptions for learning and career conversations; no vacancy and no deployment decision implied.', 'ملف مفاهيمي لعام 2035: يبني التوائم الرقمية ويحوكمها بمعزل عن أنظمة التحكم في المفاعل. المتطلبات افتراضات تخطيطية لأغراض التعلّم والحوار المهني؛ لا توجد وظيفة شاغرة ولا قرار نشر ضمني.', '[{"id":"sg-jtm","label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ssg-trends-2025","label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends in 2025 (AI potential on tasks, critical core skills)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-technology","label":"ENEC · Barakah technology","url":"https://www.enec.ae/barakah-plant/technology/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-presight","label":"ENEC · ENECIQ with Presight (Oct 2025)","url":"https://www.enec.ae/en/news/latest-news/enec-and-presight-co-develop-eneciq-ai-platform-to-boost-efficiency-and-knowledge-sharing/","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
('rpv-fr-process-heat-2035-v1', 'fr-process-heat', '2035', 1, 'published', true, false, '[{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"en-01","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Design control has to cover software and data models as configuration items.","why_ar":"يجب أن يشمل ضبط التصميم البرمجيات ونماذج البيانات بوصفها عناصر تهيئة.","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"pf-02","level":4,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-da-01-analysis","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"Engineering judgement increasingly starts from plant data: trending, simple statistics and clear charts.","why_ar":"يبدأ الحكم الهندسي بشكل متزايد من بيانات المحطة: تحليل الاتجاهات والإحصاءات البسيطة والرسوم الواضحة.","driver":"digital_ic"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-en-01-project","level":2,"importance":"useful","why_en":"Factory-built modules and international projects shift work towards project controls and owner''s engineering.","why_ar":"تنقل الوحدات المصنّعة في المصنع والمشاريع الدولية العمل نحو ضبط المشاريع وهندسة المالك.","driver":"smr_design"},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-pf-02-advcool","level":2,"importance":"important","why_en":"Awareness of passive safety and advanced coolants prepares for any future advanced-reactor work; no deployment decision implied.","why_ar":"يهيئ الوعي بالسلامة الذاتية والمبرّدات المتقدمة لأي عمل مستقبلي على المفاعلات المتقدمة؛ دون أي قرار نشر ضمني.","driver":"smr_design"}]'::jsonb, array['digital_ic','smr_design']::text[], 'Concept profile for 2035: Studies how high-temperature heat could serve industrial users; exploratory only. Requirements are planning assumptions for learning and career conversations; no vacancy and no deployment decision implied.', 'ملف مفاهيمي لعام 2035: يدرس كيف يمكن لحرارة العمليات العالية أن تخدم المستخدمين الصناعيين؛ استكشافي فقط. المتطلبات افتراضات تخطيطية لأغراض التعلّم والحوار المهني؛ لا توجد وظيفة شاغرة ولا قرار نشر ضمني.', '[{"id":"sg-jtm","label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ssg-trends-2025","label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends in 2025 (AI potential on tasks, critical core skills)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"enec-technology","label":"ENEC · Barakah technology","url":"https://www.enec.ae/barakah-plant/technology/","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"wnn-advance","label":"WNN · ENEC to evaluate deployment of SMRs and microreactors (ADVANCE)","url":"https://world-nuclear-news.org/articles/enec-to-evaluate-deployment-of-smrs-and-microreact","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
('rpv-fr-adv-instructor-2030-v1', 'fr-adv-instructor', '2030', 1, 'published', true, false, '[{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"ld-01","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"competency","ref_id":"ns-01","level":3,"importance":"important","why_en":"Required for this role at this horizon (planning assumption).","why_ar":"مطلوب لهذا الدور في هذا الأفق (افتراض تخطيطي).","driver":null},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-ld-01-instruct","level":3,"importance":"core","why_en":"New content still follows the systematic approach to training, delivered by qualified instructors.","why_ar":"يتبع المحتوى الجديد النهج المنهجي للتدريب ويقدمه مدربون مؤهلون.","driver":null},{"kind":"skill","ref_id":"sk-pf-02-advcool","level":2,"importance":"core","why_en":"Awareness of passive safety and advanced coolants prepares for any future advanced-reactor work; no deployment decision implied.","why_ar":"يهيئ الوعي بالسلامة الذاتية والمبرّدات المتقدمة لأي عمل مستقبلي على المفاعلات المتقدمة؛ دون أي قرار نشر ضمني.","driver":"smr_design"}]'::jsonb, array['smr_design']::text[], 'Concept profile for 2030: Teaches advanced reactor fundamentals to staff and students using the systematic approach to training. Requirements are planning assumptions for learning and career conversations; no vacancy and no deployment decision implied.', 'ملف مفاهيمي لعام 2030: يدرّس أساسيات المفاعلات المتقدمة للموظفين والطلاب وفق النهج المنهجي للتدريب. المتطلبات افتراضات تخطيطية لأغراض التعلّم والحوار المهني؛ لا توجد وظيفة شاغرة ولا قرار نشر ضمني.', '[{"id":"sg-jtm","label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ssg-trends-2025","label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends in 2025 (AI potential on tasks, critical core skills)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"ngt310","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 (2011) Workforce planning for new nuclear power programmes","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-08"},{"id":"wnn-advance","label":"WNN · ENEC to evaluate deployment of SMRs and microreactors (ADVANCE)","url":"https://world-nuclear-news.org/articles/enec-to-evaluate-deployment-of-smrs-and-microreact","as_of":"2026-10-08"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', null, null, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-09-20T08:00:00Z'),
