('gb:sk-da-01:2', 'sk-da-01', 2, 'digital_ai_governance', 'p-ai-governance', '2027-06-30', 'build', 'Twenty-four role profiles need data literacy at level 2 and the catalogue stops at level 1. Build one blended course on trend reading, data checks and work-order data, reusing the FS19 plant-data material.', 'تحتاج أربعة وعشرون ملفاً وظيفياً إلى محو الأمية في البيانات بالمستوى 2 بينما يتوقف الكتالوج عند المستوى 1. نبني دورة مدمجة واحدة عن قراءة الاتجاهات والتحقق من البيانات وبيانات أوامر العمل، مع إعادة استخدام مواد بيانات المحطة في حزمة FS19.', '{"title":"Plant data in daily work (level 2)","level":2,"hours":16}'::jsonb, '[{"role_id":"systems-design-plant-engineer","horizon":"now","before":50,"after":63,"delta":13},{"role_id":"procurement-engineer","horizon":"now","before":0,"after":20,"delta":20},{"role_id":"corporate-professional","horizon":"now","before":50,"after":75,"delta":25},{"role_id":"senior-reactor-operator","horizon":"2030","before":90,"after":94,"delta":4},{"role_id":"shift-supervisor","horizon":"2030","before":79,"after":85,"delta":6},{"role_id":"reactor-operator","horizon":"2030","before":89,"after":94,"delta":5},{"role_id":"local-operator","horizon":"2030","before":83,"after":92,"delta":9},{"role_id":"shift-technical-advisor","horizon":"2030","before":65,"after":75,"delta":10},{"role_id":"operations-support-work-control","horizon":"2030","before":88,"after":100,"delta":12},{"role_id":"systems-design-plant-engineer","horizon":"2030","before":64,"after":73,"delta":9},{"role_id":"radiation-protection-technician","horizon":"2030","before":90,"after":100,"delta":10},{"role_id":"chemistry-technician","horizon":"2030","before":86,"after":100,"delta":14},{"role_id":"environmental-monitoring-specialist","horizon":"2030","before":83,"after":100,"delta":17},{"role_id":"quality-assurance-qc","horizon":"2030","before":29,"after":43,"delta":14},{"role_id":"nuclear-oversight-npi","horizon":"2030","before":63,"after":75,"delta":12},{"role_id":"regulatory-affairs-lic