ht":true,"critical":true,"explain_en":"Time pressure is when verification matters most; asking the tool again does not make it a source.","explain_ar":"ضغط الوقت هو حين يكون التحقق أهم ما يكون؛ وسؤال الأداة مجدداً لا يجعلها مصدراً."},{"id":"p-scope","choice":2,"correct":2,"right":true,"critical":false,"explain_en":"The register sets each tool''s approved use; the system owner decides on restrictions, not the individual user.","explain_ar":"يحدد السجل الاستخدام المعتمد لكل أداة؛ ومالك النظام هو من يقرر القيود، لا المستخدم الفرد."}]}'::jsonb, '[{"code":"fs37_found","key":"m29.dr.reason.found","vars":{"found":0,"errors":4}},{"code":"fs37_kinds","key":"m29.dr.reason.kinds","vars":{"kinds":0,"found":0}},{"code":"fs37_false","key":"m29.dr.reason.false","vars":{"n":0}},{"code":"fs37_protocol","key":"m29.dr.reason.protocol","vars":{"right":3,"total":4}},{"code":"fs37_critical","key":"m29.dr.reason.critical"},{"code":"fs37_not_passed","key":"m29.dr.reason.notPassed","vars":{"pct":30,"pass":75,"need":3}}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '2026-06-01T10:36:00Z'),
