('rt-operations-support-work-control', 'operations-support-work-control', 'operations', 'analytical_specialist', array['ai_assist','digital_ic']::text[], 'By 2030, work-order triage, clearance drafting and schedule checks are prepared by planning tools. People keep risk judgement on work windows, clearance boundaries and coordination with the shift. Learning focus: checking tool-drafted clearances and work packages line by line. Planning assumption, no deployment decision implied.', 'بحلول 2030، تتولى أدوات التخطيط فرز أوامر العمل وصياغة العزل ومراجعة الجداول. ويحتفظ الأشخاص بـالحكم على مخاطر نوافذ العمل وحدود العزل والتنسيق مع الوردية. محور التعلّم: مراجعة العزل وحزم العمل التي تصوغها الأدوات بنداً بنداً. افتراض تخطيطي، ولا يعني ذلك أي قرار بالنشر.', 'Tools take on more routine work; people keep risk judgement on work windows, clearance boundaries and coordination with the shift. Planning assumption, no deployment decision implied.', 'تتولى الأدوات مزيداً من العمل الروتيني؛ ويحتفظ الأشخاص بـالحكم على مخاطر نوافذ العمل وحدود العزل والتنسيق مع الوردية. افتراض تخطيطي، ولا يعني ذلك أي قرار بالنشر.', '[{"label":"Workforce Singapore · Jobs Transformation Maps","url":"https://wsg.gov.sg/for-employers/jobs-transformation-maps.html","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"label":"SkillsFuture Singapore · Top skills trends 2025 (AI potential on tasks, role archetypes)","url":"https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/41/4955bc61-161d-4584-945c-7eeeb276867a/Factsheet%20on%20Top%20skills%20trends%20in%202025.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"label":"OECD AI Capability Indicators (technical report)","url":"https://digital-skills-jobs.europa.eu/en/latest/research/oecd-ai-capability-indicators-technical-report","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"label":"ENEC · ENECIQ with Presight (Oct 2025)","url":"https://www.enec.ae/en/news/latest-news/enec-and-presight-co-develop-eneciq-ai-platform-to-boost-efficiency-and-knowledge-sharing/","as_of":"2026-10-10"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-10', 'published', true, false, 1, '[]'::jsonb,